  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Cut potato into 0.5cm-thick rounds. </p> <p>• Place potato on a lined oven tray with savoury seasoning, a drizzle of olive oil and a pinch of salt and pepper. Toss to coat, spread out evenly, then roast until golden, 20 minutes. </p> <p>TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide veggies between two trays.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683d43b96329c8e5b72234eb/step-faf5cf00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, roughly chop silverbeet. Thinly slice brown onion. </p> <p>• Finely chop garlic. Thinly slice brie. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683d43b96329c8e5b72234eb/step-b6010610.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook silverbeet and onion, stirring, until tender, 3-5 minutes. </p> <p>• Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes. Season to taste. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683d43b96329c8e5b72234eb/step-3a3b8e20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Evenly stack 5 sheets of filo pastry with a drizzle of olive oil between each layer and place on a second lined oven tray.</p> <p>• Top with roasted potatoes in centre of the pastry, leaving a 4cm border around the edge.</p> <p>• Top with cooked veggies and brie slices. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683d43b96329c8e5b72234eb/step-e0e63d30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Carefully fold pastry edges over filling, leaving the centre exposed. </p> <p>• Bake galettes until golden, 15-20 minutes. </p> <p>• Meanwhile, in a small bowl, combine a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Season with salt and pepper. Add rocket and toss to coat. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683d43b96329c8e5b72234eb/step-ca7a5940.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide savoury brie &amp; silverbeet filo galette between plates. </p> <p>• Top with rocket. Serve with tomato relish. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683d43b96329c8e5b72234eb/step-f5d10950.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
